{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Chiikaw一眾角色變成飯糰</p><p>Chiikawa 粉絲準備好喇！北海道小樽的「Chiikawa MOGUMOGU 本舖」推出夏日新商品，其中最吸睛的必定是全新「飯糰公仔掛件」系列。官方把 8 位人氣角色通通變成圓碌碌的飯糰造型，每款售價 2,200 日圓（含稅），可愛程度滿分！</p><p>8款可愛飯糰造型</p><p>今次設計以不同日本美食為靈感，Chiikawa 頭頂經典酸梅，小八化身三文魚籽飯糰，兔兔則變成醬油烤飯糰；飛鼠、栗子饅頭、風獅爺、海獺師傅及古本屋亦各自換上特色造型。原本已經十分療癒的角色變成飯糰後，更加令人忍不住想全部帶回家。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627682843110713_13714772446a786bdd2c7ec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627683135852662_19788267686a786bdfb64a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627683365634143_2249704316a786be221dd0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627683603725099_12494006566a786be445fa5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627683759962302_2270628376a786be5e91b8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627683925612703_3643270516a786be78eda5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178627684128836246_11491105776a786be99b544.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17862768428271822_14010668226a786beb3e0ad.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T12:16:52.966649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}